Corvex is an original self-hosted corporate communications platform. It builds on
open-source libraries and engines (including Spring Boot, Apache James protocol
libraries planned for IMAP/POP3, SubEtha SMTP, GreenMail in tests, SpamAssassin,
ClamAV, PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, Redis and Elasticsearch). Those components remain
under their respective licenses; this NOTICE does not replace their license texts.
